		:processing_notes = "This file was produced on Tue Aug  5 16:57:23 2025 by Lynker. This update builds upon the previous version of the routelink released with NWM 3.1.\n\nKey updates and attributes are as follows:\n   - Source Data: This file uses the Lynker Reference Fabric geopackage (Reference Fabric 3.0; https://www.lynker-spatial.com/).\n   - Gage Association: Gage locations were indexed to the correct flowline using the \'hydrolocations\' table from the Reference Fabric. Preference was given to USGS sources.\n   - Unmodified Gages: Gages situated in specific water bodies (as defined by the Reference Fabric) were excluded from modification. Lake Interior (Type 2): 156 gages retained without change. Lake Outlet (Type 1): 140 gages retained without change. Total Unmodified: 296 gages\n   - Removed Gages: Four gages were removed from the dataset. Gage IDs: `11277100`, `02266291`, `382629104493000`, `06711570`. Rationale: These gages were absent from the Reference Fabric and their locations overlapped with other gages on the same stream reach.\n   - Gages Format: Gages must be 15-length character and be padded (e.g., \' \') and right shifted (left padded).\n" ;
